## What to do
1. Move the offer row/deadline start (first dispatch and re-dispatch) to after the status publish
   completes, adjacent to the courier actor send, so only the courier's response time counts.
   Keep the change inside `framework/languages/java/samples/java/DeliveryDispatch/**`.
2. Regression: a unit test for `DispatchWorker`/`DeliveryOfferStore` that delays the status publish
